1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,991
My family keeps telling me to work. But doing what?

2
00:00:03,291 --> 00:00:08,681
Chintu, one thing sells on every street these days: momos! Start a momos stall!

3
00:00:08,981 --> 00:00:10,551
But I don't know how to make momos!

4
00:00:10,851 --> 00:00:17,954
Learn from YouTube and practise for two weeks. Steamer, cart and fridge, all for ₹35,000.

5
00:00:18,254 --> 00:00:23,671
The real magic is the chutney. Make a red chutney so good that people come back.

6
00:00:24,221 --> 00:00:29,635
Bhaiya, one plate steamed, one plate fried. And extra chutney!

7
00:00:29,935 --> 00:00:33,455
Eight momos a plate for ₹70. Unlimited chutney!

8
00:00:33,755 --> 00:00:43,267
A plate costs ₹25 to ₹30 to make. Eighty plates a day saves ₹2,500 to ₹3,000.

9
00:00:43,567 --> 00:00:47,893
Add tandoori and crispy momos too. They sell for more and earn more.

10
00:00:48,193 --> 00:00:50,814
Chintu Momos, famous all over town! Life set!
